# Phase 24: Full Agent Orchestrator Implementation

> **Goal:** Implement the complete Nucleus Agent OS with event-driven orchestration
> **Scale Impact:** None - Orchestrator is also ephemeral, spawned by cron

---

## Architecture Overview

```mermaid
graph TB
    CRON[Cron Trigger] --> SYN[Synthesizer Orchestrator]
    SYN --> |Read| EVENTS[(events.jsonl)]
    SYN --> |Route| FACTORY[Context Factory]
    FACTORY --> |Spawn| CRITIC[Critic Agent]
    FACTORY --> |Spawn| DEV[Developer Agent]
    FACTORY --> |Spawn| RES[Researcher Agent]
    FACTORY --> |Spawn| STRAT[Strategist Agent]
    FACTORY --> |Spawn| ARCH[Architect Agent]
    FACTORY --> |Spawn| LIB[Librarian Agent]
    FACTORY --> |Spawn| OPS[DevOps Agent]
    CRITIC --> |Emit| EVENTS
    DEV --> |Emit| EVENTS
```

