### 4. Synthesizer Orchestrator

#### [NEW] `scripts/orchestrator.py`
The "God Mode" entry point:
1. Load event stream (last 50)
2. Match events to triggers
3. Spawn ephemeral agents via Factory
4. Monitor completion
5. Generate daily digest

#### [NEW] `scripts/meta_optimizer.py`
The 72h self-improvement loop:
1. Read performance metrics
2. Analyze agent efficiency
3. Propose prompt modifications
4. Apply changes (with rollback capability)

