## Risk Assessment

| Risk | Mitigation |
|:-----|:-----------|
| Prompt loading breaks agents | Fallback to embedded prompts |
| Event stream grows too large | Rotate/archive old events |
| Meta-optimizer breaks prompts | Git-based rollback |

